pan></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">23</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"(5) p = std::move(q);\"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"p: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"     q: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> q <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    p <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/pair\"><span class=\"kw1104\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pair</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">6</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    p <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>r<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// (7) operator=(pair&lt;U1, U2&gt;&amp;&amp; other);</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">23</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"(7) p = std::move(r);\"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"p: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"  r: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> r <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>\n(1) p = q;             p: {2, {5, 6}}     q: {2, {5, 6}}\n(3) p = r;             p: {4, {7, 8, 9}}  r: {4, {7, 8, 9}}\n(5) p = std::move(q);  p: {2, {5, 6}}     q: {2, {}}\n(7) p = std::move(r);  p: {4, {7, 8, 9}}  r: {4, {}}\n</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue885\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 885</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>missing heterogeneous copy assignment\n</td>\n<td>added (as overload <span class=\"t-v\">(3)</span>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue2729\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 2729</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++11\n</td>\n<td><code>pair::operator=</code> was unconstrained and might<br>result in unnecessary undefined behavior\n</td>\n<td>constrained\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns the contents of one <code>tuple</code> to another <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::tuple&lt;Types...&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/pair","title":"std::pair"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::pair<T1,T2>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"14 declarations; revisions: since C++11, until C++20, since C++20, since C++23. Replaces the contents of the pair."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other, p, u"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator=","note":"assigns the contents of one tuple to another"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20","C++23"],"wordCount":959,"codeBlockCount":2}
